Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:09:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1455/1463] HERESY 1536: the master's monitor, Mono and Dim,
 for the ear only (never in the mix, after the meters). The script processor's
 banks run at 4096 frames, so a stall of the page's own thread no longer
 breaks the sound when the studio is opened by its network address. A lane's A
 is lit only while its line is in hand. The spectra are drawn on a floating
 scale under their own top. A mix watched on Forge stops being watched when
 the take changes; that latent fault from 1471 threw on the name of no take.
 The spectrum's list of others no longer reads the name of no take. Catalogs
 x11; suite 1536.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
